1
00:00:00,079 --> 00:00:01,339
The metal hook on the end of a tape

2
00:00:01,399 --> 00:00:03,159
measure wobbles, and every time you notice

3
00:00:03,199 --> 00:00:04,639
it you assume the thing is worn out.

4
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:06,000
The hook is supposed to move.

5
00:00:06,279 --> 00:00:08,179
It slides exactly as far as the hook is

6
00:00:08,239 --> 00:00:09,719
thick, about a sixteenth of an inch.

7
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,180
Hook it over the edge of a board and

8
00:00:11,199 --> 00:00:13,139
it pulls out, adding that thickness back.

9
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:15,119
Push it into a corner and it slides in,

10
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:16,559
taking that thickness away.

11
00:00:16,879 --> 00:00:18,899
Either way the tape starts reading from true

12
00:00:18,959 --> 00:00:19,519
zero.

13
00:00:19,539 --> 00:00:21,119
The loosest part of the tool is the part

14
00:00:21,159 --> 00:00:21,879
keeping it honest.
